From: =?utf-8?b?Ik1hcmNvIFRyZXZpc2FuIChUcmV2acOxbyki?= <mail@3v1n0.net>
Date: Mon, 16 Mar 2026 01:10:13 +0100
Subject: panels/search: Add ability to change the search extensions

Ubuntu search provider extensions cannot be controlled from settings, so
add an option for this
---
 panels/search/cc-search-panel-row.blp |   4 +-
 panels/search/cc-search-panel-row.c   |  22 +++-
 panels/search/cc-search-panel-row.h   |   3 +
 panels/search/cc-search-panel.c       | 240 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 po/POTFILES.in                        |   1 +
 5 files changed, 267 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

